<%- include('../partials/header', { title: 'The Age Before Records' }) %>
<%
  const german = A.german;
  const flag = name => [...german].some(g => String(name).includes(g)) ? '🇩🇪' : '🇺🇸';
  const dollars = n => (n == null ? '—' : '$' + Number(n).toLocaleString('en-US'));
  const L = A.lore;
  // pre-Sleeper champions (2016-2022) from the Rolls
  const early = A.champions.filter(c => c.year <= 2022).sort((a, b) => a.year - b.year);
%>

<div class="chron">
  <a class="back-link" href="/history">← The Chronicle</a>
  <p class="chron-eyebrow">2016 – 2022</p>
  <h1 class="chron-title">The <span class="gold">Age Before Records</span></h1>
  <p class="chron-sub">Before Sleeper, before the box scores — an era known only by who took the money.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="body">
      <div class="chapter">
        <p>It started as the Balls and Wieners League. Ten guys, a hundred bucks, no
        box scores, no memory. What survives from those years is basically a list of
        who got paid and how much David complained about the buy-in going up.</p>

        <h3><span class="n">§</span> The Early Money</h3>
        <p>David took the first one in 2016 for <span class="stat">$300</span>. Then
        Cory won it in 2017 and again in 2018, back-to-back, and has been coasting on
        that ever since like it happened last week and not before half these lineups
        were legal to draft.</p>
        <p>The buy-in climbed every single year — <span class="stat">$100</span>,
        then 125, 150, 200, 250, 300, 350 — and every single year David filed his
        objection and paid anyway.</p>

        <h3><span class="n">§</span> The Marian Decade</h3>
        <p>Then Marian won three in a row. 2019, 2020, 2021. An actual three-peat,
        <span class="stat">$600</span> then <span class="stat">$750</span> then
        <span class="stat">$900</span>, while everyone else took turns finishing
        fourth and telling themselves next year.</p>

        <h3><span class="n">§</span> The Guys Nobody Remembers</h3>
        <p>Somewhere in the fog, Brandon, Taylor Hagen, and Tori got swapped out for
        Sam, Dylan, and Jeremy. No ceremony, no box score, nothing. The records can
        barely confirm they existed — the current ten first show up by name in 2019
        and have refused to leave since. (What the data actually preserves is a
        "Ben" in one draft order and nothing for "Tori"; the third name is memory,
        not record.)</p>

        <h3><span class="n">§</span> 2022, And The Thing Nobody Agrees On</h3>
        <p>The name had already changed once, from Balls and Wieners to the Whiny
        Little Bitch League, which was accurate. Then came the co-championship, split
        <span class="stat">$1,050</span> two ways, and the argument that has outlasted
        every other argument in this league.</p>
        <div class="decree" id="asterisk"><p style="margin:0">The final week's
        Bills–Bengals game was cancelled after Damar Hamlin went into cardiac arrest
        on the field. Marian was losing his matchup, the game vanished, and he and
        Sam agreed to split first and second. The ring has been disputed ever
        since.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>👑 Champions of the Age <span class="sub">what the money remembers</span></h2>
    <div class="body chron-scroll">
      <table class="ledger">
        <thead><tr><th>Year</th><th class="name">Champion</th><th>Buy-in</th><th>Title paid</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <% for (const c of early) { %>
            <tr class="champ">
              <td class="rk"><%= c.year %></td>
              <td class="name"><%= c.champion %> <span class="flag"><%= flag(c.champion) %></span><% if (c.asterisk) { %> <a class="aster" href="#asterisk">*</a><% } %></td>
              <td style="color:var(--muted)">$<%= c.buy_in %></td>
              <td class="money"><%= dollars(c.payout) %></td>
            </tr>
          <% } %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:.8rem; margin:.6rem 0 0;">
        Box scores begin in 2023 — from there, every season gets its full chapter.
        See <a class="back-link" style="display:inline" href="/history/amendments">the Amendments</a> for the buy-in ladder and the full ledger.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="provenance">Source: the master sheet — the league's founding document. The pre-Sleeper years exist nowhere else.</p>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
